# Google Analytics 4 Measurement ID (e.g. "G-XXXXXXXXXX")
# Create a free GA4 property at https://analytics.google.com to get one.
# Leave blank / omit this file's copy (.env) to disable analytics (e.g. in local dev).
PUBLIC_GA_MEASUREMENT_ID=

# Formspree endpoint for the Risk Mitigation Fund landlord application.
# Create a form at https://formspree.io with file uploads enabled, set the
# notification email to landlordfund@scucs.org, then paste the form URL here
# (e.g. https://formspree.io/f/xxxxxxxx). Leave blank until the form is live.
PUBLIC_FORMSPREE_LANDLORD_FUND_URL=
